-- Guided paths: one or more for each of the 9 topics, redone on 20 Oct 2026 from the sermon cards
-- (public.sermon_cards, a full read of every sermon by Claude Sonnet 5.5). All are drafts (status 'draft')
-- for ministry review, in order: the first is Home's "Start here".
-- Idempotent: re-running updates the text and days in place and removes days beyond each path's last
-- day. It never changes status, so a path the ministry has published stays published. Path ids are kept
-- where a path continues, so viewers' enrolments and days done (keyed by path id and day number) carry on.
--
-- How days were picked: the sermon's card topic is the path's topic at fit 4-5 (or the sermon is squarely
-- on the path's subject); Apostle Arome Osayi preaches; the video is under 3 hours; the captions are
-- readable and it isn't mostly worship; the card knows where the preaching starts; no sermon is in two
-- paths or topical series. 5-7 days in an order that builds: foundation, truth, practice, maturity.
--
-- Each day plays the whole sermon from teaching_start (the card's preaching start; null: the beginning).
-- focus_start/focus_end mark where the day's teaching is clearest and key_at/key_title/key_quote its key
-- moment. Each new key_quote is the sermon's caption words with only capitalisation and punctuation
-- added, inside one stored passage (days kept from before may also drop a stutter or filler, as approved
-- on 15 Oct); key_at is about 3 s before its first word. Times are in seconds.
--
-- Requires the paths migration (20261015000100_paths.sql), the teaching series migration
-- (20261015001000_teaching_series.sql), the teaching start migration
-- (20261020000300_path_days_teaching_start.sql) and the sermon catalogue.

begin;

insert into public.paths (id, kind, name, italic, promise, why, needs, minutes_per_day, status, sort) values
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 'path', 'Hearing the voice of God', 'voice of God',
   'Five days to recognise how God speaks to you, and to answer.',
   'For believers who long to hear God but are unsure what his voice sounds like. The path begins with the spiritual senses the new birth gives you, explains knowings and the inner voice and how to tell his voice from your own, then grounds your hearing in Scripture. It ends with why answering his gentle promptings keeps you sensitive to him.',
   array['hear-god', 'bible']::text[], 18, 'draft', 1),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 'path', 'Building a life of prayer', 'life of prayer',
   'Six days from occasional prayer to a daily place with God.',
   'For believers who want to pray but find it hard to start or to stay consistent. The path begins with why we were made to pray, then moves through giving yourself to prayer, finding the secret place, keeping your time and leaning on the Spirit, and ends with the persistence that keeps praying until the answer comes.',
   array['prayer', 'dryness']::text[], 17, 'draft', 2),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 'path', 'Discovering your purpose and calling', 'purpose and calling',
   'Seven days on why God made you, the grace you carry and how to walk steadily in your call.',
   'For anyone asking what their life is for. The path begins with the Maker who made you for his purpose and defines a call from God. It helps you take inventory of the grace on your life and shows what a call carries. It ends with faithfulness in small things, patience in hidden seasons and steadiness in your assignment.',
   array['purpose', 'calling', 'burnout']::text[], 16, 'draft', 3),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 'path', 'Learning to wait on God', 'wait on God',
   'Six days on staying faithful when God''s promise seems slow, and believing until it comes.',
   'For anyone in a season where prayers seem unanswered and promises delayed. The path begins with why God, as King, must be waited on, then shows how his word tests us before it comes to pass and how he renews our strength while we wait. It warns against helping God in the flesh, teaches us to keep his conditions and ends with believing against hope until the word is fulfilled.',
   array['waiting', 'delay', 'faith']::text[], 15, 'draft', 4),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 'path', 'Overcoming fear and anxiety', 'fear and anxiety',
   'Six days to trade anxious thoughts for the peace of God.',
   'For anyone whose mind races with worry about money, health or the future. The path shows how anxiety works on the heart, roots you in the Father who already knows your needs, then teaches you to pray through worry and rest your weight on Christ. It ends with a mind fixed on what God says and the peace that guards your heart.',
   array['fear', 'anxiety', 'future']::text[], 18, 'draft', 5),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 'path', 'Walking in grace and holiness', 'grace and holiness',
   'Five days on the grace that teaches us to live holy, and the love that makes it last.',
   'For believers who have heard that grace covers everything and want to see how grace and holiness belong together. The path corrects the abuse of grace and shows holiness as love''s answer to the One who bought us. It then builds daily consecration and godly fear, and ends with growing from grace to grace as we come to know God.',
   array['holiness', 'grace', 'drifted', 'new-believer']::text[], 18, 'draft', 6),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 'path', 'Fasting with purpose', 'with purpose',
   'Five days on why Jesus fasted, how to fast with prayer and how to live temperately.',
   'For believers who want to fast but are unsure of the reason or the right way. The path follows Jesus into the wilderness, shows how fasting starves the flesh and gives weight to prayer, sets out safe practical limits and ends with fasting as part of a temperate, disciplined life.',
   array['fasting']::text[], 18, 'draft', 7),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 'path', 'Breaking free from habitual sin', 'habitual sin',
   'Six days from the grip of a repeated sin to the freedom grace gives.',
   'For the believer who keeps returning to the same sin and is tired of starting over. The path begins with how temptation actually works and grounds you in reckoning yourself dead to sin. It then helps you lay aside the weight that clings, face the strongholds of the flesh and master your appetites, and ends at the throne of grace, for the days you fall.',
   array['same-sin', 'temptation', 'shame', 'self-control', 'purity']::text[], 17, 'draft', 8),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 'path', 'Walking with the Holy Spirit', 'Holy Spirit',
   'Seven days to know the Holy Spirit as a person and walk with him day by day.',
   'For believers who have received the Holy Spirit but long to know him as a friend and not only as a doctrine. The path begins with who he is and the wonder that he lives in you, shows how he leads you into what is real, then teaches daily filling, sensitivity to his promptings and obedience to his leading. It ends with staying close to him for his own sake rather than chasing gifts.',
   array['holy-spirit', 'presence']::text[], 20, 'draft', 9),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 'path', 'God''s wisdom for everyday life', 'everyday life',
   'Six days of God''s wisdom for your home, your relationships, your money and your daily work.',
   'For believers who want their faith to shape ordinary life at home and at work. The path begins with marriage as God''s pattern and the unity he looks for, then turns to choosing a spouse and guarding the home. It ends with faithful stewardship of money and taking every assignment seriously.',
   array['marriage', 'singleness', 'relationships', 'money', 'offence', 'forgive']::text[], 18, 'draft', 10),
  ('receiving-healing-from-jesus-the-healer', 'path', 'Receiving healing from Jesus the Healer', 'the Healer',
   'Six days to know Jesus as your Healer, receive his healing by faith and find strength for the road.',
   'For anyone who is sick, weary or broken-hearted and wants to know how God heals. The path begins with Jesus meeting our deepest need, shows what the cross has already paid for and how mercy brings it to us, then moves into faith to receive and pressing in to touch him. It ends with fresh strength for those tired enough to give up.',
   array['healing', 'grief', 'discouraged', 'rejection']::text[], 20, 'draft', 11),
  ('walking-free-in-christ', 'path', 'Walking free in Christ', 'free in Christ',
   'Seven days to understand your freedom in Christ, close old doors and stay free.',
   'For believers who sense something holding them back and want to understand freedom in Christ without fear. The path begins with Jesus'' own ministry of deliverance and the authority he gives. It then explains how the cross answers every legal claim and curse and shows how to close old doors and family altars. It ends with the daily consecration that keeps you free.',
   array['spiritual-attack']::text[], 19, 'draft', 12)
on conflict (id) do update set
  kind = excluded.kind,
  name = excluded.name,
  italic = excluded.italic,
  promise = excluded.promise,
  why = excluded.why,
  needs = excluded.needs,
  minutes_per_day = excluded.minutes_per_day,
  sort = excluded.sort;

insert into public.path_days (path_id, day, youtube_id, focus_start, focus_end, theme, key_at, key_title, teaching_start, key_quote) values
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 1, 'W0HKRnS25X0', 598.9, 1656.1, 'Your spirit was made to hear God', 1058.0, 'Created with spiritual senses', 142.0,
   'Jesus is saying you were created with spiritual senses built on your spirit. But those senses will not be relevant until you become born again.'),
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 2, 'G3UvVP7US-4', 2829.0, 3731.2, 'Knowings and the inner voice', 3065.1, 'Small impressions', 0.0,
   'A little impression is a testimony to a mighty thing.'),
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 3, 'O1u7szjsr9s', 2726.8, 3689.2, 'Telling his voice from your own', 2883.4, 'His voice or mine', 1363.0,
   'You do not live by his explanations; you live by his instructions.'),
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 4, 'wFoDwNbBdnU', 1192.5, 2313.1, 'Scripture keeps your hearing safe', 2165.2, 'Word laid up', 1.0,
   'The power of your receiving, the safety, the accuracy of the voice of God coming to you is dependent on the word of God that you have laid up.'),
  ('hearing-the-voice-of-god', 5, 'Jy8s0NXriI0', 1467.2, 2531.3, 'Obedience keeps your hearing clear', 1777.2, 'Yield to his promptings', 406.0,
   'If you continue that way for eight months you will become exceedingly powerful because the secret to power is recognizing the authority of the Holy Spirit and submitting to his government.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 1, 'khSAp7ZHAzg', 1705.5, 2720.5, 'We were made to pray', 1951.2, 'Designed to pray', 1706.0,
   'Men are designed to pray and not to faint. You see, men ought always to pray and not to faint.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 2, 'wem3w4ZPLyc', 1311.4, 2414.9, 'Give your whole self to prayer', 1322.9, 'Prayer is who we are', 1141.0,
   'Prayer is who we are and not what we do.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 3, 'TWiVZeKhO2w', 1158.8, 2199.0, 'Find your point of prayer', 1613.0, 'The point of prayer', 120.0,
   'It is when you arrive the point of prayer that you can begin to offer your prayer point.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 4, 'YGnx3g5xOzQ', 571.2, 1599.8, 'Shut the door and keep the time', 991.6, 'Shut the door', 22.0,
   'Shut the door is a serious business; it''s not something that you can do double-minded.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 5, 'ClWul-FQkXY', 2616.8, 3822.3, 'Lean on the Spirit when you pray', 3689.9, 'Quickened to pray', 0.0,
   'If you are not quickened you cannot pray. The quickening spirit will have to come and give you capacity.'),
  ('building-a-life-of-prayer', 6, 'YppJQntKrt4', 2803.2, 3711.9, 'Keep praying until heaven answers', 3146.0, 'Prayer without ceasing', 228.0,
   'Because the Bible says prayer was made without ceasing. There was no second, no minute that there was no prayer going up.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 1, '1GOnATDurW4', 1093.3, 2048.8, 'Made by God for his purpose', 1452.2, 'Given a calling', 0.0,
   'God in his wisdom decided therefore to give you a calling, give you a purpose to fulfill.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 2, 'itIp_xL8EOk', 1280.8, 2205.2, 'What a call from God is', 2066.3, 'Your meaning is your assignment', 22.0,
   'It''s not your ability that is your meaning; it''s your assignment that is your meaning.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 3, '4D2nEeGGbkk', 0.8, 1123.6, 'Take inventory of your grace', 724.9, 'Identify your grace', 1.0,
   'If you are going to advance in God you need the spirit of wisdom and revelation to identify the kind of grace that God has bestowed upon your life because you will need to feed that grace.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 4, 'S-PJ9WHJ7L8', 4241.2, 5574.4, 'A call has an objective and place', 4685.5, 'Objective and location', 4241.0,
   'It is a calling when there is an objective that God wants to achieve that implicates you as a person. The second thing that the calling must have is a location.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 5, 'diAy3fj2zcY', 1633.9, 2778.6, 'Be faithful in the little things', 2748.6, 'Small things first', 89.0,
   'If you despise those physical things you will not be on the road to the great things.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 6, 'OM5ZtIAaqJ4', 1222.7, 2210.4, 'Hidden seasons prepare you for fruit', 1451.7, 'Life through decay', 2.0,
   'Now that process of decay looks like death, but it is in that death process that pure life from the real seed can spring forth.'),
  ('discovering-your-purpose-and-calling', 7, 'aY3Nj2rgk0o', 833.2, 1619.6, 'Your assignment does not change', 1410.7, 'Your assignment stays', 115.0,
   'You will pass through many seasons in the implementation of that assignment, but the assignment itself does not change.'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 1, '-4r-s-jMFbo', 2891.6, 3591.9, 'God is a King, not a servant', 3408.7, 'Waiting on a King', 359.0,
   'The way up is waiting at the foot of the King until he stretches forth his scepter in your direction.'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 2, 'JRYFRLSLrwg', 2579.2, 3795.7, 'The waiting tests the word in you', 3258.8, 'The test of time', 163.0,
   'One of the test that God will subject everyone that is going to be a bearer of his counsel is the test of time.'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 3, 'MiE70TINsJo', 2920.4, 3694.8, 'Strength renewed for the faint', 3004.5, 'Power for the faint', 19.0,
   'The specialty of God is that he gives power to the faint.'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 4, 'EdDHjGT6zrM', 3473.1, 4430.9, 'Do not help God in the flesh', 3487.1, 'Milk or wine', 139.0,
   'Wine gets better with time; milk gets bad with time. So the question is, are you milk or are you wine?'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 5, '6vzoGqCUSDc', 6380.0, 7170.1, 'Keep the condition while you wait', 6878.0, 'Keep the condition', 4210.0,
   'The proof that you believe in a conditional promise is that you are busy fulfilling the condition.'),
  ('learning-to-wait-on-god', 6, 'TDVokmH0WAw', 3679.8, 4661.7, 'Believe against hope until it comes', 4529.9, 'Believe against hope', 1113.0,
   'No one was there when God spoke to you; you are the only one to bear the burden of your faith.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 1, 'ZhCHYmeKtb8', 1957.2, 2898.6, 'How worry fights for your heart', 2298.6, 'Worry captures the heart', 4.0,
   'Worry is suggestive of the fact that your heart territory has been captured. The circumstances have overwhelmed you so much so that it has also secured the handle of your heart.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 2, 'OqiQ6T9SAUM', 1746.6, 2664.6, 'Your Father already knows your needs', 2447.7, 'A God that knows', 0.0,
   'So if you are going to deal with a God that knows, you must become a man of faith, sufficient in your God and trusting that your God is able.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 3, 'Fal0ICd-XHw', 1189.2, 1875.1, 'Peace that holds until God answers', 1529.0, 'A place of rest', 162.0,
   'If you stay in that place of rest, not considering what is in the external, you will begin to see the sovereign hand of God.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 4, 'TngwPWUg1fQ', 2203.6, 3367.5, 'Rest your full weight on Christ', 2613.8, 'Living at his expense', 0.0,
   'That means you are not living life at your expense but you are living life at his expense. Your weight is transferred.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 5, '4ZwnaIvtKzU', 5888.1, 7191.3, 'Fix your eyes on what God says', 7004.9, 'Train your eyes', 3661.0,
   'Train yourself to consciously look away from what God says you should look away from and train yourself to look at what God is saying you should look at.'),
  ('overcoming-fear-and-anxiety', 6, 'ad13XjYt88A', 851.8, 2203.8, 'Peace that guards heart and mind', 2068.4, 'The noise goes quiet', 0.0,
   'If you find that secret place, the noise in your soul will go quiet. The question of when, the question of where, the question of why, the question of how will go quiet instantly.'),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 1, 'KPcnaSrUpDI', 367.6, 1558.8, 'Grace is not a license for sin', 841.2, 'What grace is not', 322.0,
   'The antidote for sin cannot become the reason for sin.'),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 2, 'WdEJUCQu_uo', 194.2, 1194.3, 'Holiness grows from love, not fear', 484.0, 'Holiness answers grace', 9.0,
   'Holiness should be the natural resultant effect of the receipt of grace, if we are reasonable.'),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 3, 'kSMvE2AWlTY', 3562.0, 4612.6, 'Yield yourself to God every morning', 3668.9, 'Holiness from love', 120.0,
   'Holy living is not motivated by the fear of hell. Holy living is a function of the fact that you actually stumbled on the love of God.'),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 4, 'GKjIC36hWs0', 3710.2, 4361.7, 'The fear of the Lord keeps you', 3930.5, 'The fear of the Lord', 154.0,
   'It is only the wisdom of God that can keep you from trespassing into the forbidden zone.'),
  ('walking-in-grace-and-holiness', 5, '0QjtSGDxR8s', 218.0, 1298.7, 'Grow from grace to grace', 821.8, 'Grace multiplied', 68.0,
   'You need a multiplication of grace consistently in your life, and the agency through which this grace is multiplied is through the knowledge of God and the knowledge of our Lord Jesus Christ.'),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 1, 'K7n_7hi3xuk', 650.3, 1448.3, 'Why Jesus fasted before the test', 1132.8, 'Fasting, then prayer', 1.0,
   'When Jesus said fasting and prayer, he meant the environment should not influence you, but you must influence environment.'),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 2, 'Yao8V16wrzE', 0.0, 727.9, 'Build capacity before the battle', 418.2, 'Build capacity', 0.0,
   'Don''t leave your life to chance. Don''t leave your destiny to chance. Build capacity.'),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 3, 'o2ri6m3eFD0', 1149.2, 2324.7, 'Join fasting to steady prayer', 2191.8, 'Prayer needs spice', 194.0,
   'You have to give something in order to gain the mastery. You must lose an appetite in order to gain fitness in the realm.'),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 4, 'AwoOykuNJGM', 2409.2, 3475.5, 'Fast wisely and within safe limits', 2823.5, 'It changes you', 2.0,
   'Fasting doesn''t change God; fasting actually changes you.'),
  ('fasting-with-purpose', 5, 'Zhz4TUHRmp0', 794.3, 1985.3, 'Temperance that grows a strong spirit', 897.7, 'The price of mastery', 638.0,
   'If you are striving in order for you to become proficient in the capabilities of your recreated human Spirit, the price to pay is temperance in every aspect of your life.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 1, 'G4Waap067c0', 211.3, 1240.0, 'How temptation finds its way in', 498.9, 'Temptation is personal', 84.0,
   'Temptation is idiosyncratic; temptation is particular to you.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 2, 'UwN-Tx0DDXM', 3145.0, 4160.2, 'Count yourself dead to sin', 3781.1, 'The reckoning of faith', 625.0,
   'So even though Jesus died for you, if it is not in your inventory that I am dead, you will not see the power of that death. That is what we call the reckoning of faith.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 3, 'vZCAT_AiUgc', 773.5, 1858.5, 'Lay aside the sin that clings', 1197.5, 'Identify the weights', 244.0,
   'Seeing that we are encompassed with a great cloud of witnesses, it is wise for you to identify the weights and for you also to identify that sin that has the capacity to snare you most easily.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 4, 'XHyqYaLSwPk', 1457.6, 2383.9, 'Find the flesh''s booster stations', 1708.1, 'The root is self', 3.0,
   'The foundation of all sin is self.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 5, 'QaBMqju7NQQ', 598.6, 1664.8, 'Gain mastery over your appetites', 1515.6, 'Learning to say no', 209.0,
   'Any man that cannot say no to himself cannot say no to others.'),
  ('breaking-free-from-habitual-sin', 6, 'w-Nb7lByMxg', 3837.6, 4597.6, 'When you fall, come boldly for mercy', 4303.7, 'Mercy, then grace', 115.0,
   'It''s only those that have obtained mercy that can find grace.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 1, 'pOvf4iu1TAo', 0.2, 1179.7, 'The Holy Spirit is a person sent to you', 113.6, 'Sent from the Father', 0.0,
   'The first thing we see in this verse of scripture about the person of the Holy Spirit is that he proceeds from the Father. Hallelujah, that''s where he comes from; he''s bringing an errand from the Father.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 2, 'Gw6MMqMJfog', 2061.4, 3444.6, 'He lives in you and hears you', 3370.9, 'He hears you', 1.0,
   'When last did you speak to the Holy Ghost and you had faith that he was hearing you? If you didn''t have faith that he heard you, it means you don''t know he''s dwelling in you.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 3, 'L8scGe5dxHU', 1816.4, 2845.4, 'The Spirit of truth leads into reality', 1963.8, 'Truth is reality', 201.0,
   'The spirit is the substance of every true spiritual reality that comes from the realm of God.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 4, 'HZsZfMCPpos', 1896.4, 2948.8, 'Be filled with the Spirit every day', 2250.2, 'Filled before your day', 50.0,
   'Your day has not yet started until you are filled with the Holy Spirit.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 5, 'NxPwjxeuFTM', 2280.6, 3781.3, 'Noticing his quiet signs and impressions', 2525.5, 'Build that consciousness', 183.0,
   'It is therefore your business as a believer to build that consciousness until it becomes a mighty stream. The consciousness first of all comes into you as a seed, something that can be despised.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 6, 'Nv_amRumKXU', 2232.1, 3605.4, 'Learning to follow him in small things', 3361.8, 'Led about first', 440.0,
   'What he''s trying to do is to help you to cultivate his voice, to know that voice and to work your muscles into obedience.'),
  ('walking-with-the-holy-spirit', 7, '7j9mHRAS9ZU', 2947.5, 4134.7, 'Seek the Spirit, not the spiritual', 3950.2, 'Camp with the Spirit', 130.0,
   'I learned a great lesson: instead of running after the spiritual, I will camp with the spirit.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 1, 'SZvfhVDNh8k', 173.4, 1204.0, 'Build your home on God''s pattern', 558.4, 'A heavenly replica', 0.0,
   'Marriage in this realm is a replica, is a representation of something that is spiritual.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 2, 'i7SsZ4OnUKg', 0.1, 1068.3, 'Unity is the good God looks for', 708.0, 'Years are not enough', 0.0,
   'The fact that a marriage is 45 years old does not guarantee that God will find good in that context.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 3, 'AQblidcLcN8', 4335.8, 5552.1, 'Choosing a spouse and guarding your home', 4927.2, 'Maintenance prayer for marriage', 1404.0,
   'Just like you do maintenance prayer to keep your spiritual life going, your marriage also require that level of prayer.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 4, '88Xk2ZvoCP8', 141.7, 1419.8, 'Be faithful with what you have', 288.0, 'Not born empty', 142.0,
   'Even though you were born naked, you were not born empty. You have experience in some areas, you can steward that experience.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 5, 'inEaPOZ33qU', 3359.8, 4508.4, 'Prosperity that rests on righteousness', 4263.6, 'Prosperity that endures', 3153.0,
   'The reason why we need to run under the canopy and the influence, the government of righteousness, is so that you will have prosperity that endures.'),
  ('gods-wisdom-for-everyday-life', 6, '4cdUGG-pjeE', 7009.0, 8038.4, 'Take every assignment seriously', 7421.2, 'Not like every other', 5774.0,
   'You just need to know that this assignment is not like every other assignment. Take it serious.'),
  ('receiving-healing-from-jesus-the-healer', 1, '64muMdBywHk', 2211.8, 3221.3, 'Jesus meets your real need', 2749.8, 'Your real need', 1495.0,
   'Your request may not be your need. God might ignore your requests so that he will meet your need.'),
  ('receiving-healing-from-jesus-the-healer', 2, 'fYevZJvPAyc', 997.3, 2270.9, 'Healing was paid for at the cross', 2025.3, 'Justice behind healing', 125.0,
   'It is when you understand the justice behind your healing that you can believe God for healing.'),
  ('receiving-healing-from-jesus-the-healer', 3, 'h7kHfz8_8H8', 2242.1, 3172.1, 'God''s mercy brings healing to you', 2746.2, 'Healing by mercy', 2260.0,
   'Yes, we have a right to healing in redemption, but the actualization of healing is not on the basis of right; the actualization of healing is on the basis of mercy.'),
